  goals:{protection:{name:'Suspicious requests',help:'Pause and verify before acting.'},access:{name:'Keep access to my accounts',help:'Prepare alternatives to your main sign-in methods.'},family:{name:'Prepare my family',help:'Understandable roles and checks.'},legacy:{name:'Memories and the future',help:'Instructions and archives under your control.'},business:{name:'Business continuity',help:'Work dependencies, roles and resources.'},ai:{name:'App and AI permissions',help:'Understand who or what can act for you.'},complete:{name:'The complete journey',help:'Explore all five dimensions.'}},
  clients:{Privato:'Individual or family',Professionista:'Independent professional','Creator / Influencer':'Creator / Influencer',PMI:'Small or medium business','Azienda Enterprise':'Complex organisation'},
  dimensions:{identity:'Me and my access',inventory:'What matters',trust:'People and roles',ai:'Apps, AI and authority',legacy:'Memories and future instructions'},
  dimensionsIntro:{identity:'Alternatives and recovery, without entering credentials.',inventory:'A private index of resources and dependencies kept in your own tools.',trust:'Limited roles and independent checks, not automatic delegation.',ai:'Permissions, limits, revocation and representation preferences.',legacy:'Usable instructions and official procedures, distinct from legal rights.'},
  phases:phases([
    ['Identify what matters','Start with dependencies, not secrets.',['On a private sheet, list five important categories: email, access, archives, devices and services.','For each, identify what access depends on, without entering names or credentials here.','Choose just one dependency to clarify first.'],'You have prepared an index in your own tools.','Do not upload your personal inventory or other people’s data here.'],
    ['Prepare alternative access','A new sign-in method should remain understandable and recoverable.',['Open your provider’s security settings through its official address.','Check whether it offers passkeys or a suitable second method and read its current instructions.','Before changing existing methods, prepare an independent alternative and get help if unsure.'],'You know where the method is kept and which alternative you could use.','Do not remove the last working method or close your only open session to run a test.'],
    ['Outline recovery','Consider what happens when your phone is unavailable.',['Privately identify the service that recovers your other accounts.','Check its official instructions for available alternatives.','Write down how you would reach an alternative without using the same phone.'],'You have identified a dependency and an alternative to check.','Do not paste recovery codes here or deliberately lock yourself out.'],
    ['Check one copy','A copy helps only if you can find and read it.',['Choose a harmless file created specifically for this exercise.','Keep a copy in your own tools using their instructions.','Open that copy without changing or deleting the original and note the result privately.'],'You have read the test-file copy in the stated setting.','Do not use essential archives or delete originals or backups during the exercise.'],
    ['Prepare independent verification','A voice, urgency and the displayed number do not establish identity.',['Agree on a known contact route with a relative or colleague.','Imagine an urgent money request and how you would interrupt the pressure.','Plan an independent callback and a second person if the contact is unavailable.'],'You know which independent channel you would use before deciding.','Do not stage real emergencies or send money; a family phrase alone is not sufficient.'],
    ['Define people and limits','Helping does not mean accessing everything.',['Talk to a possible helper without sharing secrets.','Define which organising tasks they could assist with and which are excluded.','Review official tools carefully: Bitwarden emergency access needs an eligible plan and may expose the whole vault or allow takeover.'],'You have discussed a role and limits to confirm.','This worksheet grants no authority or contacts; do not assign broad access just to test it.'],
    ['Review apps and agents','A forgotten permission can outlast the need that created it.',['Open your account’s official list of connected apps.','Review the purpose and permissions of one app, including any AI tools.','Prepare a stopping procedure in your own tools; check dependencies and consequences before revoking access.'],'You know where to inspect a permission and what revocation would affect.','We do not promise automatic revocation; removing a connection does not erase data the service already copied.'],
    ['Organise future instructions','Personal wishes, provider features and legal rights are different things.',['Read the official procedures of the services you use.','Consider Apple Legacy Contact or Google Inactive Account Manager only if relevant.','Prepare private questions for a professional: Apple Legacy Contact does not include passwords or passkeys.'],'You have separated data, access and professional questions to explore.','Do not trigger automatic delivery or deletion for testing; these worksheets do not replace a will.'],
    ['A Drop of Memory','Start with a memory you want to preserve in your own tools.',['Privately choose a harmless photo or a short memory.','Decide whether to keep it just for yourself or discuss future sharing.','Prepare an index and a clear instruction alongside the copy, without uploading them here.'],'You have organised one small memory outside this portal.','This guide does not create a memory archive, a replica of a person or a future delivery service.'],
    ['Review when something changes','A useful journey follows changes in your digital life.',['Think about the last change of phone, helper or application.','Mark dependent activities as needing review.','Choose a date for your next check and optionally download the reminder.'],'You have chosen a specific next review.','A missed response does not prove incapacity or death and does not trigger information transfers.']
  ]),
